# The champion with the dive armed, blood-gated on ARTILLERY (dive 3,
# divemargin 100, divecap 16, diveblood 3): a party of the three
# fastest gathered units closes on the nearest visible ground mover
# that reaches at least 100 world units beyond every land gun the army
# fields -- artillery at 290 against a 160 line, not the 165-190 movers
# -- drafted against the opening rung so it dives in time, with the
# first party held until three of our units have died to the artillery
# sighted. diveblood13 (log 2026-09-13) read the margin-free gate opening
# on deaths to plasma tanks and missile mechs on s8915497 at frame 120k,
# fifty-eight thousand frames before that seed's third artillery death,
# and lost the champion's win there; the reading blood_frames priced --
# the third death to c_artillery or mechArtillery before frame 110k on
# three of nine openers, on no touched winner and one winner in
# thirty-five -- is the reading this file carries. The 96-seed bar
# rejected the rung-arbitrated dive at 66 to 69 (divebar192); this arm
# faces the same 96 seeds against the same certified champion cards.
# Every other knob and every goals slot is the champion's exactly.
